<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Young et al. (1992) & Jaya et al. (2016) Emiliania huxleyi V/R calcite crystal coccolith rosette shield & interlocking spherical coccosphere mechanics — MorphoEval overall 48.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py` (consensus score 52.2/100). The v1 script plots only a 2D circular radial stick-spoke diagram and a 1D linear scaling curve, omitting 3D V/R bimodal crystallographic c-axis nucleation vectors and orthogonality verification (c_V . c_R = 0), elliptical baseplate eccentricity, 3D double-shield T-shaped hammer-head elements and chiral suture imbrication across morphotypes A, B, C, and R, 3D interlocking spherical coccosphere Euler packing (V - E + F = 2) and compressive load mechanics, ocean acidification / CAP-polysaccharide ablation control, 12-taxon coccolithophore validation, and CV angular FFT spoke-count and ellipse eccentricity segmentation on the vendored Emiliania huxleyi SEM specimen. Overall 48.3/100 (faithfulness 40.7, reproducibility 65.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 53, Morphological realism / specimen match 24, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 50, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 70. Output judged: docs/media/emiliania_calcite_rosette_comparison.png: rendered output of 2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py at HEAD, image/png, 129795 B, 1470×644 px, artifact_sha256 4fd30a45b53e77ab995d0da15057e887bff2a60bb84937f4f16c51d70001cdfe (sha256 4fd30a45b53e77ab995d0da15057e887bff2a60bb84937f4f16c51d70001cdfe), spec_fingerprint a04d4ad3be794a2a2b64ad6ba6e976c1273468b393c25601eaba7d3808a4fc31. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a04d4ad3be794a2a2b64ad6ba6e976c1273468b393c25601eaba7d3808a4fc31; artifact_sha256: 4fd30a45b53e77ab995d0da15057e887bff2a60bb84937f4f16c51d70001cdfe; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/emiliania_calcite_rosette/emiliania_calcite_rosette_reference.json=6e0133f11f7fd993..., datasets/emiliania_calcite_rosette/emiliania_huxleyi_coccolith_specimen.jpg=94d4b431c4912727..., datasets/emiliania_calcite_rosette/scout_manifest.json=d838aa9cca83725c...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--n-seg`, `--w0`, `--l-spoke`, `--omega`, `--n-cocc`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`), upgrade `self_test()` to an 8-point verification suite with bitwise two-run determinism, and render a 6-panel publication-grade synthesis figure and co-evolving 2-panel 3D coccolith & coccosphere morphogenesis GIF.",
        "remediation needed: Implement the full 3D Young et al. (1992) / Didymus et al. (1993) V/R crystallographic nucleation and T-shaped hammer-element morphogenetic solver across all 5 morphotype and ablation regimes: Morphotype A (N_seg=32), Morphotype B (N_seg=38), Morphotype C (N_seg=26), Morphotype R (N_seg=30, overcalcified), and Ocean Acidification / CAP-Polysaccharide Ablation Control (Omega_calcite=0.75 < 1, c_CAP=0 -> T-head truncation and loss of interlock).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/emiliania_calcite_rosette/` at runtime and perform computer-vision elliptical polar unwrapping, Difference-of-Gaussians spoke segmentation, and angular FFT analysis (`segment_emiliania_coccolith_specimen`) on `emiliania_huxleyi_coccolith_specimen.jpg`, measuring isolated coccolith spoke count N_seg = 32 (11.25 deg spacing), aspect ratio b/a = 0.8478 (eccentricity e = 0.5303), distal length L_d = 3.50 um, and left-panel coccosphere diameter D_sphere = 5.65 um.",
        "remediation needed: Model 3D interlocking spherical coccosphere assembly on S^2 using Fibonacci/Thomson spherical packing and Voronoi/Delaunay trivalent contact topology (`evaluate_coccosphere_3d_packing`, Jaya et al. 2016), verifying Euler polyhedral characteristic V - E + F = 2, trivalent identity 3V = 2E, and compressive buckling load amplification across N_cocc in [12, 24], plus 12-taxon cross-species coccolithophore scaling validation." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.83e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

